Looking at this problem, I need to analyze the nested radical $g(x) = \sqrt{1 + \sqrt{x}\sqrt{1 + \sqrt{x^2}\sqrt{1 + \sqrt{x^3}\sqrt{\cdots}}}}$ and determine whether $g(x+1) - g(x) \to 1$.

**Answer-leak check:** The problem contains no leaked answers or solution sketches. Proceeding.

